 name for S&R":"CLIPTextEncode"},"widgets_values":["eating, chewing, slowmo video, slow motion, bullet time effect, low quality video, worst quality, blurry, mutation, deformation, amputation, bad anatomy, high contrast, overexposed, oversaturated, garish colours, colour shift, colour change, camera flash, bright, deformed face, bad teeth, poor eyes, deformed eyes, aliasing, pixelation, anime, toon, manga, drawing, 色调艳丽，过曝，静态，细节模糊不清，字幕，风格，作品，画作，画面，静止，整体发灰，最差质量，低质量，JPEG压缩残留，丑陋的，残缺的，多余的手指，画得不好的手部，画得不好的脸部，畸形的，毁容的，形态畸形的肢体，手指融合，静止不动的画面，杂乱的背景，三条腿，背景人很"],"color":"#322","bgcolor":"#533"},{"id":564,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-460,-540],"size":[250,460],"flags":{"collapsed":false,"pinned":true},"order":15,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"💡Info","properties":{},"widgets_values":["Bypassing SageAttention/Triton slightly improves quality but substantially increases generation time.\n\nSageAttention and Trition significantly speed up generation, but are not installed in the standard ComfyUI. If you don't know how to install them, it's best to ask an AI. I asked [perplexity.ai](https://perplexity.ai) and was successfully guided through the installation step by step. Since the installation varies depending on the system, universal instructions cannot be provided here. Be sure to create a backup of ComfyUI beforehand, as problems during installation can also cause ComfyUI to stop working.\n\n⚠️‼️If the output video is completely black, this indicates an error with the `sage_attention` model. You should then select the model variant that matches your system configuration. Bypass the group if SageAttention and Triton are not installed‼️⚠️\n\n"],"color":"#222","bgcolor":"#000"},{"id":351,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-1120,-40],"size":[640,1360],"flags":{"collapsed":false,"pinned":true},"order":16,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"ℹ️Workflow INFO","properties":{},"widgets_values":["# VideoFlow WAN I2V v1.0\n\nThis image-to-video workflow was developed to create realistic videos at 32 fps, with a focus on fast generation in high resolution. 16GB or more of VRAM is recommended.  \n  \n💡The quality of the input image primarily influences the quality of the output video. Therefore, low-quality input images usually produce low-quality videos. Try [PhotoFlow](https://civitai.com/models/1376005/photoflow-xl?modelVersionId=1965257) to create high resolution images.  \n\n\n## Required Models Downloads\n\n### WAN Model\nSave path `ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models`:  \n\nfp8 (recommended):  \n[Download](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/WanVideo_comfy/resolve/main/Skyreels/Wan2_1-SkyReels-V2-I2V-14B-720P_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors?download=true) `Wan2_1-SkyReels-V2-I2V-14B-720P_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors`  \n\nor fp16 (best quality, slower)  \n[Download](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/WanVideo_comfy/resolve/main/Skyreels/Wan2_1-SkyReels-V2-I2V-14B-720P_fp16.safetensors?download=true) `Wan2_1-SkyReels-V2-I2V-14B-720P_fp16.safetensors`  \n\n💡This workflow also supports the original WAN 2.1 I2V 14B 720P model, but the SkyReels model is the superior choice for realism.\n\n### WAN Text Encoder\nSave path `ComfyUI/models/text_encoders`:  \n\nfp8 (recommended):  \n[Download](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors?download=true) `umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors`  \n\nor fp16 (best prompt adaption):  \n[Download](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/umt5_xxl_fp16.safetensors) `umt5_xxl_fp16.safetensors`\n\n### WAN VAE\nSave path `ComfyUI\\models\\vae`:  \n[Download](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/vae/wan_2.1_vae.safetensors?download=true) `wan_2.1_vae.safetensors`  \n\n### WAN 4 Steps LoRA Lightx2v\nSave path `ComfyUI\\models\\loras`:  \n[Download](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/WanVideo_comfy/blob/main/Wan21_T2V_14B_lightx2v_cfg_step_distill_lora_rank32.safetensors?download=true) `Wan21_T2V_14B_lightx2v_cfg_step_distill_lora_rank32.safetensors`  \n\n### Upscaler\nSave path `ComfyUI\\models\\upscale_models`:  \n[Download](https://openmodeldb.info/models/4x-UniversalUpscalerV2-Neutral) `4x_UniversalUpscalerV2-Neutral_115000_swaG.pth` \n\n## Installation\n\n### ComfyUI Manager Installation\n[https://github.com/ltdrdata/ComfyUI-Manager?tab=readme-ov-file#comfyui-manager](https://github.com/ltdrdata/ComfyUI-Manager?tab=readme-ov-file#comfyui-manager)\n\n### Installation of Missing Nodes\n\nMissing nodes in this workflow are highlighted in red. To install them, open the ComfyUI Manager and click the 'Install Missing Custom Nodes' button. \n\nYou may see an error message stating, 'Failed to find the following ComfyRegistry list. The cache may be outdated, or the nodes may have been removed from ComfyRegistry: comfyui_essentials.' This message can be safely ignored. The installation of the missing modules will complete successfully regardless.\n\nAfter the installation, restart ComfyUI and refresh the browser page.\n\n### Recommended Default Values\n\n#### WanVideoNAG\nSince the required CFG of 1.0 would ignore the negative prompt, the WanVideoNAG node solves this problem.  \n**nag_scale:** 11.0  \n**nag_alpha:** 0.25  \n**nag_tau:** 2.5  \n\nWAN is a 16 fps model. If movements are too slow you can increase the initial frame rate with the cost of a shorter video.  \n**Initial Frame Rate:** 16  \n**Frame Multiplier:** 2 (results in a final video with 32 fps)\n\n**Shift:** 1-8  \n💡 Lower values ensure the output closely matches the input image quality and prompt. Higher values offer increased creativity and improved motion, at the potential cost of a more artificial-looking quality. Start with a value of 2. In most cases 1 to 3 has the best result.\n\n\n#### KSampler\n**Sampler:** dpmpp_sde_gpu  \n**Scheduler:** beta  \n**Steps:** 4  \n**CFG:** 1.0  \n\n#### RIFE VFI  \nTo increase the frame rate, interpolation images must be generated.  \n**ckpt_name:** rife47 or rife49  \n**clear_cache_after_n_frames:** 10 (⚠️‼️lower the value if you run out of memory‼️⚠️)  \n**fast_mode**: *ignored*  \n**ensemble:** true  \n**scale_factor:** 1  \n\n#### Combine Images to Video\n**Format:** video/h264-mp4  \n**pix_fmt:** yuv420p  \n**CRF:** 19\n \n## TL;DR\nCheck my Civitai profile for updates and other workflows: [https://civitai.com/user/ai839](https://civitai.com/user/ai839)\n\n\n\n"],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":529,"type":"CLIPTextEncode","pos":[0,400],"size":[530,310],"flags":{"pinned":true},"order":20,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"clip","name":"clip","type":"CLIP","link":889},{"localized_name":"text","name":"text","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"text"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"CONDITIONING","name":"CONDITIONING","type":"CONDITIONING","links":[864]}],"title":"Positive Prompt","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.3.43","Node name for S&R":"CLIPTextEncode"},"widgets_values":["A friendly waitress in an Irish pub smiles warmly at the camera while holding up a rustic wooden tray. On the tray is a classic burger and fries meal, featuring a juicy burger with melted cheese, bacon, crisp lettuce, fresh tomato slices, and tangy pickle slices visible inside. The golden bun is sprinkled with sesame seeds, adding a rustic touch. The rendered scene shows the rich meat juices, enhancing the burger’s mouth-watering appeal. The tray also includes ketchup in small rustic bowls and a fresh, cool Coca-Cola with Carbon dioxide bubbles in it in a glass with ice cubes and a slice of lemon. The crispy, golden fries complement the meal perfectly. In the background on the left side, a man dressed in a Batman costume steps forward toward the foreground and confidently grabs the burger from the tray. The cozy pub ambiance with wooden interiors and soft lighting enhances the authentic, welcoming atmosphere."],"color":"#232","bgcolor":"#353"}],"links":[[44,3,0,8,0,"LAT